    <string name="npc_leek_1">Looks like those drones are watching you... stay away from me.</string>
    <string name="npc_leek_2">Are you really weird enough to stand next to someone without saying a word?</string>
    <string name="npc_leek_3">I\'m busy.</string>
    <string name="npc_leek_4">I think this is about to get fun.</string>
    <string name="npc_leek_5">I saw nothing. And you never saw me.</string>
    <string name="npc_leek_6">Nice hoodie. Very discreet. Very \'movie hacker\'.</string>
    <string name="npc_leek_7">Have you tried turning it off and on again? I mean your life.</string>
    <string name="npc_leek_8">Don\'t click on any weird links. Or any drones.</string>
    <string name="npc_leek_9">Better keep walking. I\'ll stay right here, bravely, watching.</string>
