    <string name="npc_leek_11">No, I\'m not selling anything. And stop staring at my sunglasses.</string>
    <string name="npc_leek_12">I\'ve been waiting for someone for hours... and it wasn\'t you.</string>
    <string name="npc_leek_13">If you see something weird on the street, that\'s normal. Keep walking.</string>
    <string name="npc_leek_14">They say hackers never sleep. Your eye bags agree.</string>
