    <string name="story_wake_1">What time is it...?</string>
    <string name="story_wake_2">Another sleepless night.</string>
    <string name="story_obj_computer">Too many things open... I should tidy this up some day.</string>
    <string name="story_obj_desk">Cold coffee, cables everywhere... the usual.</string>
    <string name="story_obj_window">Looks like it will rain all night.</string>
    <string name="story_contact">Known contact</string>
    <string name="story_incoming">Incoming call</string>
    <string name="story_in_call">On call</string>
    <string name="story_call_ended">Call ended</string>
    <string name="story_answer">ANSWER</string>
    <string name="story_call1_01">Are you awake?</string>
    <string name="story_call1_02">You? What\'s going on? It\'s so late...</string>
    <string name="story_call1_03">I need you to listen to me for a moment.</string>
    <string name="story_call1_04">Did something happen?</string>
    <string name="story_call1_05">I think we have a problem.</string>
    <string name="story_call1_06">What kind of problem?</string>
    <string name="story_call1_07">I was looking into a few things and found something pretty strange.</string>
    <string name="story_call1_08">What did you find?</string>
    <string name="story_call1_09">I can\'t explain it over the phone. I sent something to your computer. Check it out.</string>
    <string name="story_call2_01">So? What did you find?</string>
    <string name="story_call2_02">I don\'t even know where to begin...</string>
    <string name="story_call2_03">You sound strange. Are you okay?</string>
    <string name="story_call2_04">I got into something I should never have touched.</string>
    <string name="story_call2_05">What are you talking about?</string>
    <string name="story_call2_06">I can\'t tell you. Not even you. I don\'t want to put you in danger.</string>
    <string name="story_call2_07">Wait... How serious is it?</string>
    <string name="story_call2_08">Enough for somebody to want to make sure this never comes to light.</string>
    <string name="story_call2_09">I already have all the proof.</string>
    <string name="story_call2_10">What proof?</string>
    <string name="story_call2_11">I saved it on a USB drive. Documents, records, everything I could gather. It\'s ready to be handed over.</string>
    <string name="story_call2_12">And what are you going to do with it?</string>
    <string name="story_call2_13">I\'m going to hand it to the police myself.</string>
    <string name="story_call2_14">Are you serious?</string>
    <string name="story_call2_15">I know they might put me in jail for what I did. But it doesn\'t matter anymore. The world has to know what I just found out.</string>
    <string name="story_call2_16">I also left a text file on my computer.</string>
    <string name="story_call2_17">A text file? What for?</string>
    <string name="story_call2_18">It\'s a message for my family. In case something happens to me... I want them to know what happened and why I did all this.</string>
    <string name="story_call2_19">I don\'t like how you\'re talking.</string>
    <string name="story_call2_20">I just want to make sure that, if I don\'t come back, someone can explain everything to them.</string>
    <string name="story_call2_21">You\'re not going to disappear. Did you hear me?</string>
    <string name="story_call2_22">I hope you\'re right.</string>
    <string name="story_call2_23">You\'re an idiot...</string>
    <string name="story_call2_24">I know.</string>
    <string name="story_call2_25">But you\'re an idiot I\'m not going to leave alone.</string>
    <string name="story_call2_26">I don\'t want you getting into this.</string>
    <string name="story_call2_27">Too late.</string>
    <string name="story_call2_28">I\'m going to watch over you.</string>
    <string name="story_call2_29">What?</string>
    <string name="story_call2_30">I\'m going to try to get into any security cameras I find along the way. I want to make sure you get there safely.</string>
    <string name="story_call2_31">You don\'t have to do that.</string>
    <string name="story_call2_32">I\'m not asking.</string>
    <string name="story_call2_33">And please... be careful. I don\'t want anything to happen to you.</string>
    <string name="story_call2_34">I\'ll be fine. I promise.</string>
    <string name="story_call2_35">You\'d better.</string>
    <string name="story_notif_title">NOTIFICATION</string>
    <string name="story_notif_body">New file received.\nName: \"NO_ABRIR.txt\"</string>
    <string name="story_file_name">NO_ABRIR.txt</string>
    <string name="story_file_text">I don\'t know who is behind this.\n\nI found records that shouldn\'t exist.\nThere are connections that keep repeating, and devices\nthat show up even when they are disconnected.\n\nI tried to trace the origin, but someone\ndeleted part of the records.\n\nDon\'t keep searching from your usual connection.\n\nI need you to come see me.\n\nAnd please, don\'t trust everything you find.</string>
    <string name="story_chat_name">Mandy (5 km away)</string>
    <string name="story_chat_request">(sent you a plumber request).....</string>
    <string name="story_chat_question">\"Do you feel like working?\"</string>
    <string name="story_chat_yes">YES</string>
    <string name="story_chat_no">NO</string>
    <string name="story_infect_title">ENCRYPTING FILES...</string>
    <string name="story_infect_error">ERROR</string>
    <string name="story_ransom_title">K-LOCKER 2.0</string>
    <string name="story_ransom_header">Oops, your files have been encrypted!</string>
    <string name="story_ransom_pay_label">The payment will double in</string>
    <string name="story_ransom_lost_label">Your files will be lost in</string>
    <string name="story_ransom_time_left">Time left</string>
    <string name="story_ransom_text">What happened to my computer?\nYour files are encrypted. Documents, photos, projects and databases can no longer be opened. Don\'t waste time looking for another way: nobody can open them without our key.\n\nCan I recover my files?\nYes, if you pay in time. You have 3 days to send the payment. After that the price doubles. After 7 days your files are lost for good.\n\nHow do I pay?\nPayment is accepted only in CRED, a fictional currency of this game. Send the amount to the address in this window and press &lt;Check payment&gt;.</string>
    <string name="story_ransom_send">Send 300 CRED to this address:</string>
    <string name="story_ransom_address">KS-0000-DEMO-0000</string>
    <string name="story_ransom_check">Check payment</string>
    <string name="story_ransom_decrypt">Decrypt</string>
    <string name="story_ransom_no_payment">No payment detected.</string>
    <string name="story_ransom_need_payment">Pay first to get the key.</string>
    <string name="story_ransom_close">CLOSE</string>
    <string name="story_alt_01">So? Were you able to open what I sent you?</string>
    <string name="story_alt_02">No. The computer got infected. It\'s encrypted, with a notice and a countdown that won\'t stop.</string>
    <string name="story_alt_03">What do you mean infected? What did you do?</string>
    <string name="story_alt_04">I clicked where I shouldn\'t have. A stupid mistake. Now I can\'t use it anymore.</string>
    <string name="story_alt_05">Easy. Breathe. There must be a way to fix it.</string>
    <string name="story_alt_06">Not tonight. Everything I needed was on that machine.</string>
    <string name="story_alt_07">...Tell me you\'re joking.</string>
    <string name="story_alt_08">I wish.</string>
    <string name="story_alt_09">Then go get some sleep. We\'ll look at it tomorrow with a clear head.</string>
    <string name="story_alt_10">Yeah... I\'ll fix it tomorrow.</string>
    <string name="story_alt_11">Promise me.</string>
    <string name="story_alt_12">I promise.</string>
    <string name="story_alt_13">You\'d better. Good night, clumsy.</string>
    <string name="story_alt_final">I can\'t do anything else tonight.</string>
    <string name="story_end_1">I can\'t do anything else.</string>
    <string name="story_end_2">I\'m going back to sleep.</string>
    <string name="story_end_3">Tomorrow I\'ll fix it.</string>
    <string name="story_end_title">ALTERNATIVE ENDING</string>
    <string name="story_end_subtitle">\"No Signal\"</string>
